{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-4-1","title":"Revelation 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 John sees the throne of God in heaven. 4 The four and twenty elders. 6 The four beasts full of eyes before and behind. 10 The elders lay down their crowns, and worship him that sat on the throne.</p>\n<p>After. 1:1-3:22 a door. Ex 1:1; Mt 3:16; Mr 1:10; Lu 3:21; Ac 7:56; 10:11 the first. 1:10; 16:17 Come. 11:12; Ex 19:24; 24:12; 34:2,3 and I. 1:19; 22:6; Joh 16:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-2","title":"Revelation 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>I was. 1:10; 17:3; 21:10; Eze 3:12-14 a throne. 5; 20:11; Isa 6:1; Jer 17:12; Eze 1:26,28; 10:1 and one. 9; 3:21; 5:1,6,7,13; 6:16; 7:9-17; 12:5; 19:4; 21:5; 22:1-3; Isa 6:1 Da 7:9; Heb 8:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-3","title":"Revelation 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>like a. 21:11,19,20; Ex 24:10; Eze 1:26; 28:13 a rainbow. 10:1; Ge 9:13-16; Isa 54:9,10; Eze 1:28 like unto. 21:19; Ex 28:18; 39:11; Eze 28:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-4","title":"Revelation 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>were four. 11:16; 20:4; Mt 19:28; Lu 22:30 four and twenty. 10; 5:8,14; 7:11; 19:4 clothed. 3:4,5; 6:11; 7:9,13,14; 19:14 crowns. 2:10; 9:7; Es 8:15; Ps 21:3; 2Ti 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-5","title":"Revelation 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>proceeded. 8:5; 11:19; 16:17,18; Ex 19:16; 20:18; Ps 18:13,14; 68:35; Joe 3:16 Heb 12:18-29 seven. Ge 15:7; Ex 37:23; 2Ch 4:20; Eze 1:13; Zec 4:2,11-14 the seven. 1:4; 3:1; 5:6; Mt 3:11; Ac 2:3; 1Co 12:4-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-6","title":"Revelation 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>a sea. 15:2; Ex 38:8; 1Ki 7:23 crystal. 21:11; 22:1; Job 28:17; Eze 1:22 the midst. 5:6; 7:17; Eze 1:4,5 four beasts. 8,9; 5:6,14; 6:1; 7:11; 14:3; 15:7; 19:4; Eze 1:5-28; 10:14 full. 8; Eze 1:18; 10:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-7","title":"Revelation 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the first beast. 6; Ge 49:9; Nu 2:2-34; 23:24; 24:9; Pr 28:2; Eze 1:10; 10:14,21 like a calf. Eze 1:10; 1Co 9:9,10 as. 1Co 14:20 a flying. De 28:49; 2Sa 1:23; Isa 40:31; Eze 1:8,10; 10:14; Da 7:4; Ob 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-8","title":"Revelation 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>six. Isa 6:2-13; Eze 1:6; 10:21,22; 2Ti 4:2 full. 6; 1Ti 4:16 and they. 7:15; Isa 62:1,6,7; Ac 20:31; 1Th 2:9; 2Th 3:8,9 rest not. Gr. have no rest. Holy. 3:7; Ex 15:11; Isa 6:3 Lord God Almighty. 1:8; 11:17; 15:3; 16:7,14; 19:15; 21:22; Ge 17:1; Ps 91:1; Isa 13:6 Joe 1:15; 2Co 6:18 which. 4; Heb 13:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-9","title":"Revelation 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>when. 5:13,14; 7:11,12 who. 1:18; 5:14; 10:6; 15:7; Ex 15:18; Ps 48:14; Heb 7:8,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-10","title":"Revelation 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>fall. 5:8,14; 19:4; Job 1:20; Ps 72:11; Mt 2:11 worship. 9; 7:11; 15:4; 22:8,9; 1Ch 29:20; 2Ch 7:3; Ps 95:6; Mt 4:9,10 Lu 24:52 cast. 4; 1Ch 29:11-16; Ps 115:1; 1Co 15:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-4-11","title":"Revelation 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>art. 5:2,9,12; 2Sa 22:4; Ps 18:3 to receive. 14:7; De 32:4; 1Ch 16:28,29; Ne 9:5; Job 36:3; Ps 29:1,2; 68:34 Ps 96:7,8 for thou. 10:6; Ge 1:1; Ex 20:11; Isa 40:26,28; Jer 10:11; 32:17; Joh 1:1-3 Ac 17:24; Eph 3:9; Col 1:16,17; Heb 1:2,10 and for. Pr 16:4; Ro 11:36</p>"}]}